# ChemKitchen Teaching Tool Enhancement

Enhance the ChemKitchen application to transition it from a pure simulation into an educational tool. This involves adding guided lessons, safety validation for chemical reactions, and scientific explanations for synthesis steps.

## Proposed Changes

### Core Chemistry Engine

#### [MODIFY] [constants.ts](file:///r:/Antigravity%20Multiple/ChemKitchen/ChemKitchen/constants.ts)
- [x] Update `COMBINATION_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION` to require a scientific explanation for each reaction.
- [x] Update `COMBINATION_RESPONSE_SCHEMA` to include an `explanation` field (Type.STRING).
- [x] Add `SafetyFeedback` interface.
- [x] Add `SAFETY_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION` and `SAFETY_RESPONSE_SCHEMA` for a new Safety Validator Agent.
- [x] Add [Lesson](file:///r:/Antigravity%20Multiple/ChemKitchen/ChemKitchen/constants.ts#39-45) and [LessonStep](file:///r:/Antigravity%20Multiple/ChemKitchen/ChemKitchen/constants.ts#33-38) interfaces for structured teaching.
- [x] Added `LESSONS` array with initial curriculum.
- [x] Expanded `STARTING_INGREDIENTS` with 100+ pharmaceutical compounds.

### Simulation Logic

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///r:/Antigravity%20Multiple/ChemKitchen/ChemKitchen/App.tsx)
- Add state at [LabAppContainer](file:///r:/Antigravity%20Multiple/ChemKitchen/ChemKitchen/App.tsx#1397-1602) levels:
    - `isLessonMode` (boolean)
    - `currentLesson` (Lesson | null)
    - `currentStepIndex` (number)
    - `safetyFeedback` (SafetyFeedback | null)
- Update `executeCombination` to:
    - Extract and return the `explanation` field from the API response.
    - Add the explanation to the [TimelineEntry](file:///r:/Antigravity%20Multiple/ChemKitchen/ChemKitchen/constants.ts#46-56).
- Update `executeAction` to:
    - Call `validateSafety` before executing the combination.
    - Check if the `newIngredient` matches the `objective` of the `currentStep` if in lesson mode.
    - Advance `currentStepIndex` if the objective is met.

